<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\コーヒー豆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Two Beginner Coffees, please."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Coming right up!
{PAUSE ""}
　Huh, that's a rare order.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, it's for a couple who don't care for coffee, <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">her companion</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE>, huh. Come to think of it, it's always water and cake with her. 
{PAUSE ""}
A couple, so it's her boyfriend?<PG>
"Hmm, I wonder. 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't mean to speak ill of a customer, but his looks are a bit..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Not very good-looking?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I suppose... so. Enough that he doesn't quite match <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I see. Well, 'there's no accounting for taste,' as they say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"'There's no accounting for taste.' So you can never tell what people will like."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―But still, whatever kind of customer it is, we treat them with all the hospitality we've got. That's the heart of Primavera.<PG>
"Of course. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's just..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hm?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's just, the other customers seem to be looking at <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE>'s table with curious eyes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Like, why is a beauty like <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE> with a man like that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes. I just hope <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">her companion</STYLE> aren't made to feel uncomfortable..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hmm, this is one thing we can't step in on from our side...<PG>
"Ah, then I'll go greet <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE> once more. 
{PAUSE ""}
Primavera has become famous as an upscale cafe, so if I treat her as a regular who has been coming since the day we opened, I'm sure the other customers will see them differently."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Well, just don't make a big show of it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Treating every customer with equal hospitality is also the heart of Primavera, after all.<PG>
"Yes. Until a girl comes along that I can hand the star-girl title on to, I'll serve our customers with all my heart."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I doubt you'll find many girls like you, though. 
{PAUSE ""}
Calling yourself the star girl of this shop isn't that easy, you know.<PG>
"No, I'm sure there's a woman right here in Motoki-cho who could be a more wonderful waitress than me. 
{PAUSE ""}
Until she comes, I'll help out so this shop can become a fine one."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Ha ha ha! Being able to say that much is what makes you a star girl. 
{PAUSE ""}
But still, someone at your level is pretty hard to... 
{PAUSE ""}
All set! Two Beginner Coffees for <STYLE ID="1">Kanai-sama</STYLE>, off you go!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
